          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">i didnt know i was broken until i wanted a change</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;As a consequence for losing Shadow Weaver, Catra receives her punishment: an exclusive, one-way trip to Beast Island. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beast Island is as dangerous as the legends say, but there's something hidden underneath the horrors of the island above. Something . . . that may just reveal secrets about herself that Catra didn't know existed. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Who are the Magicats? Why do the Queens trust her so much? And why does Catra feel an intrinsic draw to the caves of Half Moon?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>shutupimshakira (Sniperdoodle)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
